{"id":"650847","name":"捞汁虾滑","author":"食·色","authorId":"34360","desc":"","cover":"images/650847/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾滑","amount":"1包"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"}],"sub":[{"name":"海鲜捞汁","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"用料：虾滑1包，香菜1根，珍选海鲜捞汁适量，红椒少许，蒜2瓣。","img":"images/650847/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香菜洗净切段，蒜去皮剁成末，红椒切小丁，备用。","img":"images/650847/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒水，煮开后转小火。","img":"images/650847/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将虾滑在抹刀上挤一长条。","img":"images/650847/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"一段段拨入锅中。","img":"images/650847/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"虾滑熟透浮起。","img":"images/650847/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出控水。","img":"images/650847/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/650847/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入红椒，香菜，蒜末。","img":"images/650847/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入捞汁。","img":"images/650847/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀后食用。","img":"images/650847/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"香菜等配菜与调味料可以随意变换。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}